# OSF-Suite Architecture Documentation

## Overview

OSF-Suite is a self-hosted AI-powered sales coaching platform. It records or ingests
sales call audio, transcribes it, runs AI analysis against a configurable company
context, and returns structured meeting intelligence and agent coaching feedback.

