## External Entry Points

| Entry Point | Bound To | Auth | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|
| insights-service :8001 | 0.0.0.0 | JWT Bearer | Primary surface — has auth |
| ollama :11434 | 0.0.0.0 | None | No auth — bind to 127.0.0.1 |
| AWS RDS :5432 | VPC/security group | Password | Rotate credentials regularly |
| AWS SQS | AWS IAM | IAM key | Low risk — IAM scoped |
| AWS S3 (presigned URLs) | Public per URL | Scoped + expiring | Low risk — time-limited |

**Internal only (not reachable outside Docker network):**
- whisper-service :8000
- osf-redis :6379

