## Database Schema

### agents
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | String (UUID) | Primary key |
| name | String | Display name |
| email | String | Unique, indexed |
| hashed_password | String | bcrypt, 12 rounds |
| api_key | String | `osf_` prefix + 40 random chars |
| is_active | Boolean | Soft disable |
| created_at | DateTime | UTC |

### meetings
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | String (UUID) | Primary key |
| user_id | String | FK → agents.id, indexed |
| status | String | `recording` → `processing` → `done` / `failed` |
| transcript | Text | Full diarized transcript |
| insights | JSON | Full nested insights object (see Output Schema) |
| chunks | Integer | Number of audio chunks processed |
| created_at | DateTime | UTC |
| completed_at | DateTime | UTC, set when status = done |

### company_context
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | String (UUID) | Primary key |
| agent_id | String | FK → agents.id, indexed |
| version | String (UUID) | Unique per upload |
| source_type | String | `pdf` / `docx` / `text` |
| original_filename | String | Null for raw text input |
| extracted_text | Text | Plain text, max 50,000 chars |
| is_active | Boolean | Only one active per agent at a time |
| created_at | DateTime | UTC |

