## Redis Key Schema

| Key | Type | Value | TTL |
|---|---|---|---|
| `meeting:{meeting_id}` | Hash | `status`, `chunks`, `transcript`, `user_id`, `insights`, `coaching` | None |
| `agent_context:{agent_id}` | String | Extracted plain text of active company context | 7 days (refreshed on upload) |

