## Rate Limits

| Endpoint group | Limit |
|---|---|
| /agents/register | 5 requests/minute |
| /agents/login | 10 requests/minute |
| /meetings/* | 100 requests/minute |

Enforced via `slowapi` using agent ID (from JWT) or IP address as the key.

