## Token Lifecycle

| Token | Default expiry | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| access_token | 480 minutes (8 hours) | API authentication |
| refresh_token | 7 days | Obtain new access token |

The PowerShell client auto-refreshes the token when it detects expiry
(`$tokenExpiry` checked before each step).